END NETS
SPECIALNETS 2 ;
    - VDD ( * VDD ) + USE POWER
      + ROUTED metal3 200 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 24000 80000 ) ( 24000 80200 )
      NEW metal4 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 56000 79000 ) ( 56000 80000 )
      NEW metal4 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 55600 80540 ) ( 56400 80540 )
      NEW metal5 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 86000 80000 ) ( 88000 80000 )
