      NEW metal6 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 118000 80000 ) ( 120000 80000 )
      NEW metal6 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 120540 79000 ) ( 120540 81000 ) ;
    - SIG1 ( * SIG1 ) + USE SIGNAL
      + ROUTED metal3 200 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 24000 28000 ) ( 24000 28200 )
      NEW metal4 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 56000 27000 ) ( 56000 28000 )
      NEW metal4 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 55600 28540 ) ( 56400 28540 )
      NEW metal5 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 86000 28000 ) ( 88000 28000 )
      NEW metal5 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 88540 27000 ) ( 88540 29000 )
      NEW metal6 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 118000 28000 ) ( 120000 28000 )
      NEW metal6 280 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 120540 27000 ) ( 120540 29000 ) ;
END SPECIALNETS
END DESIGN
